        "refutation": "The reachable helper actions do not mutate state and do not expose protected admin-only data. `actionList()` enumerates published sliders only, content search returns published posts only, and browse/index enumerates files under the public image root rather than arbitrary server paths in a default deployment.",
        "conclusion": "Rejected as a vulnerability. The missing `smartslider_*` capability checks on these helper endpoints do not produce measurable security impact in Patchstack terms."
